Hathy was added in '''Beta 30.0''' with the ability to give +1 ATK whenever another ally monster attacks. This was nerfed in the exact same way as [https://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Artifacts Veteran] (in Beta 20.2) in '''Beta 30.1''', where its effect now only works on monsters with at least 3 ATK already.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 1

HP: 6

Cost: 4

Abilities:
* Support: Give the attacker +1 ATK. (Beta 30.0)
* Support: Give the attacker +1 ATK if it has => 3 ATK. (Post Beta 30.1, Current)
Rarity: White (Common)
